      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ich warte dort auf dich!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490063006800200077006100720074006500200064006F00720074002000610075006600200064006900630068002100100002011401890000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Das ist Teil zwei des besten aller\nBaugerüst-Parcours!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nDein Ziel ist es, ihn innerhalb von <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>40 Sekunden<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>\nabzuschließen. Bist du bereit?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 149
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aber so was von!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100620065007200200073006F002000770061007300200076006F006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Noch mal? Och nö...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 3672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F006300680020006D0061006C003F0020004F006300680020006E00F6002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Komm schon! Zeig diesem Froxy, was wir\nMenschen, nein, was DU draufhast!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 3712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Das lob ich mir! Beweise Froxy noch einmal,\nwie toll du bist!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 3868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006100730020006C006F006200200069006300680020006D00690072002100200042006500770065006900730065002000460072006F007800790020006E006F00630068002000650069006E006D0061006C002C000A00770069006500200074006F006C006C00200064007500200062006900730074002100100002011401890000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿&",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Unglaublich! Du bist ein regelrechtes Wunderkind\nder Baugerüst-Parcours!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...Zumindest fast. Die Herausforderung geht noch\nweiter!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E005A0075006D0069006E006400650073007400200066006100730074002E002000440069006500200048006500720061007500730066006F00720064006500720075006E0067002000670065006800740020006E006F00630068000A007700650069007400650072002100100002011401890000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Frooox!",
